<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-096" chapter-id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan" source-id="s-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan">
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:house" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:house:m0000" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">虞潭</persName>母<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:house:m0003" ref="yj3_o5t_p49">孫氏</persName>，吳郡富春人，<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:house:m0012" ref="572_278_cba">孫權</persName>族孫女也。初適<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:house:m0021" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">潭</persName>父<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:house:m0023" ref="izi_e36_p1g_A">忠</persName>，恭順貞和，甚有婦德。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">于時會稽內史<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0006" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">王舒</persName>遣子<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0010" ref="a04_d8f_416">允之</persName>為督護，<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0016" ref="yj3_o5t_p49">孫氏</persName>又謂<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0020" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">潭</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0024" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">王府君</persName>遣兒征，汝何為獨不？」<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0038" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">潭</persName>即以子<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0042" ref="9v9_cj5_dor_B">楚</persName>為督護，與<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0048" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">舒</persName><persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:sons:m0049" ref="a04_d8f_416">允之</persName>合勢。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:mourning" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">拜武昌侯太夫人，加金章紫綬。<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:mourning:m0014" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">潭</persName>立養堂于家，<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:mourning:m0021" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王導</persName>以下皆就拜謁。咸和末卒，年九十五。<persName id="c-jinshu-096-jin076-yutan:mourning:m0040" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA">成帝</persName>遣使弔祭，諡曰定夫人。</p>
</text>
